      "content": "The technocrats' moral crusade is nothing but a cynical ploy to guilt-trip us into surrendering our sovereignty, forcing us to choose between our own survival and the fleeting ideals of a global utopia. They claim we have a moral obligation to maintain the status quo, but what they're really peddling is a twisted form of eugenics, where the value of human life is measured by our ability to conform to their technocratic vision. The truth is, our only moral duty is to our own people – to protect, provide for, and preserve our nation's unique character, rather than sacrificing it on the altar of a faceless, globalized ideal. By embracing the technocrats' \"global morality,\" we're not just betraying our own interests, we're actively contributing to the erosion of our very humanity.",
      "source": "target",
